# Vercel CLI deploys upload the working tree. Without this it sent 40195 files
# and was refused at 15000 — the monorepo's node_modules and build output are
# the bulk of it, and Vercel reinstalls and rebuilds anyway.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo
.git
.claude
coverage
**/coverage

# Suites no deployed surface imports.
#
# `design/` IS NOT LISTED, and that is deliberate rather than an oversight.
# Excluding it looked obviously right — it is the reference bundle, not code —
# and it broke the build: `packages/tokens/src/generate.ts:21` reads
# `design/tokens/avo-tokens.json`, which CLAUDE.md calls the only place a hex
# may be written. `pnpm build` regenerates the tokens from it on every deploy,
# so the design bundle is a build input, not documentation.
e2e

# Native mobile build artifacts. The scanner's CocoaPods tree contains a
# symlink to an .xcframework that does not resolve off a Mac, and the deploy
# refused the whole upload over it. Neither deployed surface imports any of
# this — the wallet and scanner ship through App Store Connect.
**/ios
**/android
**/Pods
